    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Numbers go up. So does the chaos.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sheep Clicker Royale\u00a0</strong>\ud83d\udc11 is a fast-paced, highly polished clicker game where you defeat increasingly ridiculous sheep to grow your power, unlock bonuses, and chase ultimate wool domination.<br>Upgrade your stats, hunt bizarre sheep, capture them, and repeat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >all carefully balanced to deliver that <i>perfectly satisfying</i> idle loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Tons of Upgrades</strong> \u2013 Boost your click power, idle gains, and more. Every number matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd86 <strong>30+ Sheep to Discover (and Destroy)</strong> \u2013 Yes, sheep. No, they\u2019re not friendly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc51 <strong>Master Sheep</strong> \u2013 Defeat elite sheep to unlock game-changing bonuses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Quests &amp; Objectives</strong> \u2013 Complete missions to unlock features and earn sweet rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Idle Income</strong> \u2013 Capture and sell sheep to earn passive income.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Achievements</strong> \u2013 Track your progress and show off your sheep-slaying skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 <strong>Rebirth System</strong> \u2013 Start fresh with powerful new currency and permanent upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbe <strong>Auto Save</strong> \u2013 Never lose your flock. Your progress is safe.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc11 Why play?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because <i>clicking sheep is more fun than it sounds.</i><br>Whether you\u2019re in it for a quick boost of dopamine or a full-blown wool empire, <strong>Sheep Clicker Royale</strong> offers a funny, addicting, and rewarding idle experience.</p>",
